# W29, host a (k10): hosts b in stag0101, follows b into dng101b1; then two fake guests take the gate to stag0101,
# where nobody of a's instance is (a guest's NEW: a new stage group of a's instance): four players, online_host counts.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
wander -150 -60 20 until present=1,frames>=60
log b left for the cave
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=600
explore matz00 yes until stage=dng101b1,control
log a in dng101b1
wander 0 0 30 until present=2,sealed>=600
log a joined b in the cave
wander 0 0 30 until sealed>=7200
log a hosted four
